#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:7
#: 8d8b9b8f5e034ac7842106942238d1fe
msgid ""
"This page explains how to install BlueOS on an RPI compute module connected "
"to an autopilot via ethernet.  `BlueOS official installation instructions "
"can be found here <https://blueos.cloud/docs/latest/usage/installation/>`__"
msgstr ""
"本页说明如何在通过以太网连接到飞控的 RPI 计算模块上安装 BlueOS。`BlueOS 官方安装说明请见此处 "
"<https://blueos.cloud/docs/latest/usage/installation/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:9
#: 48bf90cf8f8e4d8aaef0c884cb69ca0f
msgid ""
"These instructions were originally posted on `this blog post "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/ardupilot-and-blueos-for-companion-"
"computers/134879>`__"
msgstr ""
"本说明最初发布于 `此博客文章 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/ardupilot-and-blueos-for-"
"companion-computers/134879>`__"

