"CM4v2/tree/master>`__，需要如下图红色所示的四个焊接桥接以启用以太网支持"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:35
#: e8af64b40bcb49959dcb179ad77cf2d7
msgid "Installing BlueOS on RPI4 or RPI5"
msgstr "在 RPI4 或 RPI5 上安装 BlueOS"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:37
#: ce2b8c9c22c547c7878491ab7fff15d3
msgid "Install rpiboot and rpi-imager on your Ubuntu or Windows PC"
msgstr "在您的 Ubuntu 或 Windows PC 上安装 rpiboot 和 rpi-imager"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:39
#: 01442e73b53441cc968d29b07a0bd8bc
msgid "**Ubuntu** users should run"
msgstr "**Ubuntu** 用户应运行"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:41
#: 8a367698d9c14024ba3f3dfc9617eb8b
msgid "sudo apt install rpiboot"
msgstr "sudo apt install rpiboot"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:42
#: db0ee224815040d1a09a9eb8687ffe96
msgid "sudo apt install rpi-imager"
msgstr "sudo apt install rpi-imager"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:44
#: 82bb9c59bd1f47b392aa30aac3573659
msgid ""
"**Windows** user instructions are `here "
"<https://www.raspberrypi.com/documentation/computers/compute-"
"module.html#set-up-the-host-device>`__ but in short you should:"
msgstr ""
"**Windows** 用户说明见 `此处 "
"<https://www.raspberrypi.com/documentation/computers/compute-"
"module.html#set-up-the-host-device>`__，简要步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:46
#: 6bc685328f8c44a3ba9717bd738b0f2c
msgid ""
"`download and install rpiboot "
"<https://github.com/raspberrypi/usbboot/raw/master/win32/rpiboot_setup.exe>`__"
msgstr ""
"`下载并安装 rpiboot "
"<https://github.com/raspberrypi/usbboot/raw/master/win32/rpiboot_setup.exe>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:47
#: 50fa9772f45747f7add5111700b95431
msgid ""
"`download and install rpi-imager <https://www.raspberrypi.com/software/>`__"
msgstr "`下载并安装 rpi-imager <https://www.raspberrypi.com/software/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:49
#: c0c4522321814bfe842d9ac58b542479
msgid "On the RPI I/O board"
msgstr "在 RPI I/O 板上"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:51
#: f03e0add0d55410cb647ba27a8b0eeb0
msgid "Mount the RPI CM4/CM5 on the RPI I/O board"
msgstr "将 RPI CM4/CM5 安装到 RPI I/O 板上"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:52
#: eecb43906ca2428ea24eda880cb21073
msgid ""
"Add jumper so the RPI CM starts in bootloader mode, \"Fit jumper to disable "
"eMMC Boot\""
msgstr "添加跳线使 RPI CM 以引导加载程序模式启动，「安装跳线以禁用 eMMC 启动」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:53
#: c4adbcd3830a47f8b89b210298458110
msgid "Connect I/O board to PC via USB"
msgstr "通过 USB 将 I/O 板连接到 PC"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:54
#: 12915ccf632d4224a43cd4007b76de8c
msgid ""
"Power on the I/O board (if using the RPI5 I/O board this step is probably "
"done by the above step)"
msgstr "为 I/O 板上电（如使用 RPI5 I/O 板，此步骤可能已由上一步完成）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:56
#: b47bb25a74864e68ae0904d7ff12aa39
msgid "On your PC"
msgstr "在您的 PC 上"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:58
#: 3fda4c7f5e2744b9af66e4ebae891500
msgid ""
"Open a web browser to the `BlueOS release page "
"<https://github.com/bluerobotics/BlueOS/releases>`__, select a recent "
"release of 1.5.0 or higher, open \"Assets\" and download \"BlueOs-raspberry-"
"linux-arm64-v8-bookworm-pi5\" (if this image isn't available, pick a "
"different release)"
msgstr ""
"在浏览器中打开 `BlueOS 发布页面 <https://github.com/bluerobotics/BlueOS/releases>`__，选择"
" 1.5.0 或更高版本，展开「Assets」并下载「BlueOs-raspberry-linux-arm64-v8-bookworm-"
"pi5」（若该镜像不可用，请选择其他版本）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:59
#: 2d1e8b446cbb4ab9b4e5785be54c9da6
msgid "run rpiboot:"
msgstr "运行 rpiboot："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:61
#: b72d1e82994845c5b0ed4b1454cbc146
msgid "**Ubuntu** users should open a terminal and enter \"rpiboot\""
msgstr "**Ubuntu** 用户打开终端并输入「rpiboot」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:62
#: 8d9a70cc437f4cab8a2f301b862492f0
msgid ""
"**Windows** users should open the start menu and run \"rpiboot-CM4-CM5 Mass "
"Storage Gadget\""
msgstr "**Windows** 用户打开开始菜单并运行「rpiboot-CM4-CM5 Mass Storage Gadget」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:64
#: 99af1df04e9c43ef99f8e4dc66722d58
msgid "run rpi-imager:"
msgstr "运行 rpi-imager："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:66
#: 6376534f8b914b70b30768dccaa2fe2d
msgid "**Ubuntu** users should open a terminal and enter \"rpi-imager\""
msgstr "**Ubuntu** 用户打开终端并输入「rpi-imager」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:67
#: 748d5026a65e4c70b48bddd9fb40552b
msgid "**Windows** users should open from start menu run \"Raspberry Pi Imager\""
msgstr "**Windows** 用户从开始菜单运行「Raspberry Pi Imager」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:69
#: e1c68a889b344d558444e752539b6241
msgid "from within RPI Imager:"
msgstr "在 RPI Imager 中："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:71
#: 533975283e2d4f8bab29549f539ceff2
msgid "Choose Device: \"Raspberry Pi 4\" or \"Raspberry Pi 5\""
msgstr "选择设备：「Raspberry Pi 4」或「Raspberry Pi 5」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:72
#: 524d3918599641178c9f0cb9dbd23eb2
msgid "Operating System: Use custom, select downloaded BlueOS .img file"
msgstr "操作系统：使用自定义，选择已下载的 BlueOS .img 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:73
#: 9e6bc68b2faf49e3853488180a031f4c
msgid "Storage: select RPI drive (should have appeared after rpiboot was run)"
msgstr "存储：选择 RPI 驱动器（运行 rpiboot 后应已出现）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:74
#: afb92f1df7fe47a9ab580d06cb025eb3
msgid "Select \"No\" when asked to apply special settings"
msgstr "询问是否应用特殊设置时选择「否」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:77
#: b74a0be146fc48f9be227893659ed6c6
msgid "Configuring BlueOS"
msgstr "配置 BlueOS"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:79
#: d3c5a643411240a389bb7b0f29ffd77c
msgid ""
"After the above installation is complete, perform the initial setup of "
"BlueOS"
msgstr "完成上述安装后，进行 BlueOS 初始设置"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:81
#: a4e6ddb982174ecd84e8a70f46b66b01
msgid "Configure RPI/BlueOS to connect to your local WiFi:"
msgstr "配置 RPI/BlueOS 连接到本地 WiFi："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:83
#: 43bb2de2ae674b159bd6e1cbd9c774b5
msgid "Leave the RPI4/RPI5 on the I/O board initially"
msgstr "最初将 RPI4/RPI5 保留在 I/O 板上"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:84
#: 74f19aba2c154d7098a841c5a9ea0178
msgid "Make sure a WiFi antenna is attached to the RPI4/RPI5 CM"
msgstr "确保 WiFi 天线已连接到 RPI4/RPI5 CM"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:85
#: 447d9fe85d0942869e86ab23921ee914
msgid ""
"Remove the Jumper and power-down/power-up the I/O board so the RPI boots "
"normally"
msgstr "移除跳线并重新上电 I/O 板，使 RPI 正常启动"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:86
#: b1d56cdd642048b79e097c51b600a808
msgid "Connect to BlueOS via Wifi"
msgstr "通过 WiFi 连接到 BlueOS"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:88
#: deab1d1a8e7944fdb128cbff8132a64e
msgid ""
"Wait a few minutes for the \"BlueOS\" wifi access point to appear (password "
"is \"blueosap\")"
msgstr "等待几分钟，待「BlueOS」WiFi 热点出现（密码为「blueosap」）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:89
#: 852dda1643c94734a53085aa6c9b2140
msgid ""
"Open a Chrome browser to http://blueos-hotspot.local, BlueOS should appear"
msgstr "用 Chrome 浏览器打开 http://blueos-hotspot.local，BlueOS 界面应会出现"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:91
#: ac2233e4e9d24145b48f6ffed54f00c1
msgid "OR connect directly via ethernet"
msgstr "或直接通过以太网连接"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:93
#: c7de39e290be4716994a93645ec32d84
msgid "Connect a PC via ethernet to the I/O board's ethernet port"
msgstr "通过以太网将 PC 连接到 I/O 板的以太网口"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:94
#: c63dcf2d8a54489eac5d9c22e31b9ee3
msgid ""
"Set the PC's IP address to manual with IP 192.168.2.100 (the RPI's default "
"IP address is 192.168.2.2 and we want the PC to be within the same ethernet "
"subnet)"
msgstr "将 PC 的 IP 地址手动设为 192.168.2.100（RPI 默认 IP 为 192.168.2.2，PC 需在同一以太网子网内）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:95
#: 32d56406bb534c88bd2cfb54e3f54258
msgid "Open a Chrome browser to http://192.168.2.2, BlueOS should appear"
msgstr "用 Chrome 浏览器打开 http://192.168.2.2，BlueOS 界面应会出现"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:97
#: ebfea7d0ddda49c88258a977bb227e72
msgid ""
"Once BlueOS appears, a setup wizard should appear, select \"Other vehicle "
"setup\""
msgstr "BlueOS 出现后，设置向导应会显示，选择「其他飞行器设置」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:99
#: e89c1cdd395e4388b412ea5f21d8fd9a
msgid "Vehicle Name: MyCopter"
msgstr "飞行器名称：MyCopter"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:100
#: e1b6c5fd01fe4bda991733777c00c3bd
msgid "MDNS Name: \"blueos\" (default)"
msgstr "MDNS 名称：「blueos」（默认）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:102
#: dd054b66f8c94b05aff03cb48ea1d886
msgid ""
"On the top right, select the WiFi icon and connect to your local WiFi.  If "
"you were connected to the RPI's WifiAP, you may need to reconnect using "
"http://blueos-avahi.local"
msgstr ""
"右上角选择 WiFi 图标并连接到本地 WiFi。若之前连接到 RPI 的 WiFi 热点，可能需要重新通过 http://blueos-"
"avahi.local 重新连接"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:104
#: e9c97aa2d983480dbfb3d3fee7cbb0e9
msgid ""
"Configure RPI/BlueOS's Ethernet IP to be the same subnet as the autopilot "
"and camera:"
msgstr "配置 RPI/BlueOS 的以太网 IP，使其与飞控和摄像头在同一子网："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:106
#: b2ea240d222d469ebe51dc2620316d7d
msgid "Push the buddha icon on the top right and change to \"Pirate mode\""
msgstr "点击右上角的佛像图标，切换到「Pirate mode」（海盗模式）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:107
#: 3e534e37fd2c42bc86e68be8f12e4caf
msgid "Select the networking icon"
msgstr "选择网络图标"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:109
#: b6ff25824c6d4e78807bf672e37b3c2b
msgid "select \"eth0\""
msgstr "选择「eth0」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:110
#: da3b5f6a52b14eec94fb428d8dfa2924
msgid ""
"select \"ADD STATIC IP\" and enter 192.168.144.20  (this will be the RPI's "
"IP address on the vehicle)"
msgstr "选择「添加静态 IP」并输入 192.168.144.20（这将是飞行器上 RPI 的 IP 地址）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:111
#: dad9d8e24001487190974784ba1da59c
msgid "select \"DISABLE DHCP SERVER\""
msgstr "选择「禁用 DHCP 服务器」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:112
#: 62498e388ae7468f9a10f99f669b32e5
msgid ""
"beside \"192.168.2.2 Static IP\" push the trash can icon.  At this point if "
"you were connected directly via ethernet you will lose contact with BlueOS "
"but you can re-gain contact by changing the PC's manual IP address to "
"192.168.144.100 and reconnecting with the web browser to "
"http://192.168.144.20"
msgstr ""
"在「192.168.2.2 静态 IP」旁点击垃圾桶图标。此时若通过以太网直接连接，将会断开与 BlueOS 的连接，但可将 PC 的手动 IP "
"地址更改为 192.168.144.100，然后通过浏览器访问 http://192.168.144.20 重新连接"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:113
#: 410095b871e643a29cec96501363b585
msgid "restore PC's IP address to automatic"
msgstr "将 PC 的 IP 地址恢复为自动获取"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:115
#: b268f4c24b494c7689a6276b30072ec5
msgid "Connect RPI/BlueOS to Autopilot and Camera:"
msgstr "将 RPI/BlueOS 连接到飞控和摄像头："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:117
#: 97b2b56b37e4410fa75051d9368d2b9f
msgid ""
"Follow :ref:`DroneNet <common-botblox-dronenet>` or :ref:`CubeNodeETH "
"<common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth>` setup instructions.  This should result in "
"these IP addresses for other components:"
msgstr ""
"按照 :ref:`DroneNet <common-botblox-dronenet>` 或 :ref:`CubeNodeETH <common-"
"cubepilot-cubenodeeth>` 的设置说明进行操作。其他组件的 IP 地址应为："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:119
#: ff08439b7a034b6f9db3990b6398ca0d
msgid "DroneNet/CubeNodeETH: 192.168.144.14"
msgstr "DroneNet/CubeNodeETH：192.168.144.14"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:120
#: 2bed584aa58d47018a1d6117edcd2aa9
msgid "Autopilot: 192.168.144.15"
msgstr "飞控：192.168.144.15"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:121
#: d521a26101634b06af3dc8344132763c
msgid ":ref:`Siyi A8 <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>`: 192.168.144.25"
msgstr ":ref:`Siyi A8 <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>`：192.168.144.25"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:123
#: 652c9180acb241bdbaa9e63ab6271bdc
msgid ""
"On the autopilot, create an additional UDP Server connection for BlueOS to "
"connect to:"
msgstr "在飞控上，为 BlueOS 创建额外的 UDP 服务器连接："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-install.rst:125
#: b98a4c5977a0465687c09f48a9bc0b98
msgid "NET_P1_TYPE = 2 (UDP server)"
